{"title":"Ghost Story Club (Remake)","synopsis":"On his first day at **Nakseong High*\", *Lee Jun* enters more than a new environment. After a status window warns him of the school's horror stories, he is killed in a wave of gore and sent back to his first day. This time, Jun ignores the ominous window and tricks fate, only to be killed again three years later, forced to restart high school, and lead a brand-new horror story club. Pulled into this life-and-death game, can *Jun* rewrite the **Nakseong urban legend** once and for all?","alternative_title":"괴담 동아리 (2024), Ghost Story Club (Remake)","author":"OnlyFun (오직재미), Parrot Kim (앵무새)","artist":"HayaroB (햐롭)","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Horror","Mystery"],"chapters":[{"id":"bde5fd29-49e7-4702-bc0d-4817fe8e4114","number":"77","title":"Chapter 77","date":"2025-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"3ba8f804-306c-4db5-b051-2d121d945352","number":"76","title":"Chapter 76","date":"2025-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"43d7315e-73e0-4297-bc0f-8b87d7ab5279","number":"75","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2025-11-22","images":[]},{"id":"08dff891-889b-4a5e-9906-a01c1b544d23","number":"74","title":"Chapter 74","date":"2025-11-22","images":[]},{"id":"ea06f5b7-6f00-408f-a80d-e68c452c250c","number":"73","title":"Chapter 73","date":"2025-10-31","images":[]},{"id":"a2f799ee-28b8-4f0b-9589-c290a65599b7","number":"72","title":"Chapter 72","date":"2025-10-31","images":[]},{"id":"19744e60-4feb-49d5-8695-a70ccdab7639","number":"71","title":"Chapter 71","date":"2025-10-25","images":[]},{"id":"4b5e73dd-5149-4ed3-b75c-5a1f084eac53","number":"70","title":"Chapter 70","date":"2025-10-15","images":[]},{"id":"597bd041-b9e9-4c57-b4c3-97cb915d8b8d","number":"69","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2025-09-20","images":[]},{"id":"005cf735-9904-4651-a68c-3658266cea30","number":"68","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2025-09-20","images":[]},{"id":"61bcf3d8-f640-47af-b088-1b634850b5c6","number":"67","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2025-09-11","images":[]},{"id":"25cec3b8-a